    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Naval cannon on a wooden truck carriage: cast barrel with muzzle swell, reinforce rings, cascabel and touch hole, four wooden wheels, iron axle caps, side brackets, bolts and breeching rings, plus three loose cannonballs. Wood grain and rust weathering wrap continuously around the carriage and the underside is fully modelled. No foundry mark or cypher on the barrel.",
    "limitations": [
      "Not rigged in the shipped glTF: the upstream Blender rig (elevation and recoil) is not exported to glTF.",
      "Cannonballs are loose separate objects, not stacked or secured."
    ],
